## Interface: 30300
## Title: Combat Cursor Highlight
## Notes: Draws a bright, customizable ring around your mouse cursor while you are in combat, so you never lose it in the middle of a fight. Configure via /ccursor config or Game Menu -> Interface -> AddOns -> CombatCursor.
